#%PAM-1.0
# gniri's lock screen: unlocking with a fingerprint, asked for while the
# password prompt shows. Without this file (or the distribution's
# fingerprint-auth, which gniri uses if this is missing) no finger is asked
# for. See data/pam/gniri.
#
# Written for Fedora and its relatives. Elsewhere:
#     auth    required    pam_fprintd.so
auth        substack      fingerprint-auth
account     include       fingerprint-auth
